Merge trunk 6c1a78c8 (refuse table-entry writes into tables NDTwin owns) into feat/p4-ternary-writer-a
The real-p4info flow_5tuple test now checks both changes: the write is refused as NDTwin's
table before it is built, and the builder still encodes the ternary field with its mask and
priority. The UNSPECIFIED-table write test binds a user pipeline so it reaches the 501 it is
about. The install-time gate keeps trunk's citation of the commit its baseline was red at.


